flowchart LR
    U[Upload request] --> API[API: auth + bounded spool]
    API --> TX[DB transaction: artifact + dispatch]
    TX --> ACK[202 + operation id]
    TX --> Q[(PostgreSQL dispatch)]
    Q -->|claim + lease| WK[Worker]
    WK --> IMP[EvidenceImporter]
    IMP --> RC[RunnerConnector]
    RC -->|worker-only Unix socket| RUN[Runner: network none / no DB]
    IMP --> DB[(ImportJob + SourceRecord + audit)]
    API -. status read .-> DB
